<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:22px;">Your volunteer account has been deactivated</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Dear {{firstName}}, your Parinaam Foundation volunteer account was deactivated by our team. You will not be able to sign in while it stays inactive, and you will not receive session invitations.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Your volunteering record — hours, trainings and certificates — is kept safely and comes back with the account if it is reactivated.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">If you believe this is in error, or you would like to return to volunteering, write to us at <a href="mailto:admin@parinaam.org">admin@parinaam.org</a> — we are happy to help.</p>
<p style="margin:0;color:#5E6E7E;font-size:13px;">Thank you for the time you have given to the communities we serve.</p>
